msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:324
msgid "Signing key(s)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:327
msgid "One key per line. A report must then arrive signed with any one of them, and a report signed with a key that is not here is refused. Several lines is how a key is rotated: add the new one, wait for cached pages carrying the old one to expire, then delete the old one. Empty means no signature is asked for."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:328
msgid "A key that is sent to the browser is public."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:328
msgid "It is in the page source, so anyone who wants it has it. Signing raises the cost of sending junk to the endpoint from a script that has not read your page — it is spam deterrence beside the rate limit, and it is not authentication. Do not treat it as securing the endpoint."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:329
msgid "The bundled panel does not sign yet: signing arrives in bugbottle 0.7.0. Until this plugin ships that bundle, filling this in will refuse every report the panel sends."
msgstr ""

